### Report keystroke cancellation to the caller

**Severity:** `high`

Focus changes and a missing foreground window are normal cancellation paths for this feature, not exceptional failures. Returning a boolean lets the caller distinguish a deliberate abort from a real injection error and avoids logging the keystroke path as a success when nothing was typed.

