### Surface canceled or failed keystroke pastes

**Severity:** `high`

Telemetry is currently emitted only after typing succeeds, so canceled or failed injections disappear from the invocation stream. Move the event logging before the background send, propagate the boolean cancellation result, and re-show the window when a visible keystroke paste aborts so the user sees the error state instead of a silent close.

